{"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2></strong><br>In Woods is a roguelike survival game set in a forest. Fight different monsters, craft items, and defeat the final boss for victory.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2></strong><br><strong>Fight against Monsters</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/1.gif?t=1750774669\" /></div><br>In each game, you'll face numerous attacking monsters. Fight against them and survive for as long as possible.<br><br><strong>Power Up the Character</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2.gif?t=1750774669\" /></div><br>As you defeat a certain number of monsters, your character will level up and have the opportunity to choose a magic item.<br><br><strong>Craft Items</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/3.gif?t=1750774669\" /></div><br>You also have the ability to craft items with woods.<br><br><strong>Defeat the Final Boss</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/4.gif?t=1750774669\" /></div><br>Survive for a specific duration and face the final boss and claim victory by defeating it.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Monster Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2113770/3935b9a1f539a47c915f059a2878623fd2495637.jpg"},{"name":"Attacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2113770/7304d17045ddb0b57876a17579a7c2be72fed3d1.jpg"},{"name":"Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2113770/67c957a752ec10c92f8bbbd858a5583d53884731.jpg"},{"name